  "notes": "COMPOUNDS:\n- {放射|ほうしゃ}{線|せん}: radiation (rays)\n- {放射|ほうしゃ}{能|のう}: radioactivity\n- {放射|ほうしゃ}{性|せい}⟦{物質|ぶっしつ}→物質：03608_busshitsu⟧: radioactive material\n- {放射|ほうしゃ}{状|じょう}: radial (spreading outward in a pattern)\n- {放射|ほうしゃ}⟦{冷却|れいきゃく}→冷却：09796_reikyaku⟧: radiative cooling\n\nUSAGE:\n{放射|ほうしゃ} itself is a neutral scientific term meaning \"emission\" or \"radiating outward.\" The nuclear/radiation sense comes from the compounds {放射|ほうしゃ}{線|せん} and {放射|ほうしゃ}{能|のう}.",
